/-!
# `shafarevich_z_construction` from the **inertia-killing of the transfer**

`Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_z_construction` asks for a cochain `z` with six clauses.  Five of them are
satisfied by the explicit candidate `z := y` extended by `0` off `G_K`; the entire content is the
last clause at a finite place `B ∉ cs(S)` completely decomposed in `Λ|k`:

> there is an open `V ≤ G_k` with `decomp k B ⊓ V` normalised by `decomp k B`,
> `decomp k B / (decomp k B ⊓ V)` cyclic generated by one element, and the transfer
> `X δ = ∑_{s : Gal(K/k)} s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)` vanishing on `decomp k B ⊓ V`.

By `Work.SSGRoute.exists_V_of_cyclic_transfer` this clause is equivalent to the *cyclicity* of the
image `X (decomp k B)`, and there are two known sufficient conditions for it:

* (**the "unramified" condition**) `z` vanishes on the inertia of every `G_k`-conjugate of `B`
  — `Work.SSGRoute.transfer_vanishes_of_unramified`;
* (**Schmidt--Wingberg's condition (b)**) some conjugate of `B` carries a cyclic local component of
  `z` while `z` vanishes on the local group of every other conjugate
  — `Work.SSGRoute.transfer_clause_of_single_conjugate`.

This file isolates a *third*, strictly weaker sufficient condition and wires the node's conclusion to
it:

> (**the "inertia-killing" condition**) `X` kills the inertia of `B`:
> `∀ σ ∈ decomp k B, IsInertia k B σ → X σ = 0`.

This is the hypothesis of `Work.SSGRoute.ZConstruction.exists_V_of_transfer_inertia_vanishing`
(`ZConstruction/transferInertiaVanishing.lean`, proved in this workspace).  It is strictly weaker
than the "unramified" condition, because the latter constrains the local components of `z` at every
conjugate of `B` *separately* while the inertia-killing condition only constrains their *sum*; it is
precisely because of this gap that the deep half of the paper's §4 (the second clause of
`Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_theorem13_of_z_conjugate_vanishing`) is non-empty.

## Theorems of this file

* `zClauses_of_agrees_on_fixingSubgroup` — the five elementary clauses of the node's conclusion,
  transported from `y` to any cochain `Z` agreeing with `y` on `G_K` (in particular to the extension
  of `y` by `0` off `G_K`), together with the identity of the transfers of `Z` and of `y` on the
  decomposition group of a place split in `K`.
* `shafarevich_z_construction_of_VClauseZData` — the formal observation that the node's conclusion
  follows from the five elementary clauses together with the last clause itself (the direct analogue
  of `Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_z_construction_of_zData` with the sharpened condition (b) replaced by
  the clause it is used to prove).
* `shafarevich_z_construction_of_inertiaKillingZData` — the node's conclusion from the five
  elementary clauses and the inertia-killing condition (`ZConstruction/transferInertiaVanishing`).
  Its sixth hypothesis is *incomparable* with the sharpened condition (b) of
  `Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_z_construction_of_zData`: neither of the two conditions implies the
  other, so this is a genuinely different route to the node.
* `shafarevich_z_construction_of_transferInertia` — the same with `z` instantiated to the extension
  of `y` by `0` and the hypothesis stated on the transfer of `y` itself: **the node's conclusion is
  reduced to a single condition on the datum `y`, with no arithmetic input.**
* `shafarevich_z_construction_of_conjugateUnramified` — the special case in which the transfer of `y`
  kills the inertia because `y` is unramified at every `G_k`-conjugate of every completely
  decomposed place outside `cs(S)` (the form in which `Work.SSGRoute.transfer_vanishes_of_unramified`
  proves the last clause).
* `shafarevich_z_construction_of_unramifiedOutside` — the régime of the paper's hypothesis (H1).
-/

open scoped Pointwise

namespace Work.SSGRoute.ZConstruction

open _root_.SSGRoute

set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false
set_option linter.style.haveILetI false
set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000

/-! ## The five elementary clauses, transported to a cochain agreeing with `y` on `G_K` -/

/-- **The five elementary clauses of the node's conclusion for a cochain `Z` which agrees with the
datum `y` on `G_K = K.fixingSubgroup`** (in particular for the extension of `y` by `0` off `G_K`):
`Z` is a `1`-cocycle on `G_K` for the trivial action, locally constant, agrees with `y` on the
decomposition groups of `cs(S)`, kills the involutions, and is unramified at the places outside
`cs(S)` that are not split in `Λ`.  Moreover the transfers of `Z` and of `y` agree on the
decomposition group of every finite place split in `K`. -/
theorem zClauses_of_agrees_on_fixingSubgroup
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω] (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)]
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y Z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (hZ : ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup → Z σ = y σ)
    (hy : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, y (g * h) = y g + y h)
    (hyc : SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup y)
    (hyS : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → y σ = 0)
    (hyinf : ∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → y c = 0)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s) :
    SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup Z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup Z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → Z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → Z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → Z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k K B →
        ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B →
          Work.SSGRoute.transfer Z sec σ = Work.SSGRoute.transfer y sec σ) := by
  classical
  have hres1 : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.res k K g = 1 :=
    fun g hg => (res_eq_one_iff_mem_fixingSubgroup (K := K) g).mpr hg
  refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩
  · -- the cocycle clause
    intro g hg h hh
    have hgh : g * h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup := K.fixingSubgroup.mul_mem hg hh
    rw [hres1 g hg, one_smul, hZ (g * h) hgh, hZ g hg, hZ h hh, hy g hg h hh]
  · -- local constancy
    obtain ⟨U, hUopen, hUc⟩ := hyc
    refine ⟨U, hUopen, fun g hg u hu huK => ?_⟩
    have hgu : g * u ∈ K.fixingSubgroup := K.fixingSubgroup.mul_mem hg huK
    rw [hZ (g * u) hgu, hZ g hg, hUc g hg u hu huK]
  · -- agreement with `y` on the decomposition groups of `cs(S)`
    intro B hB hconj σ hσK hσd
    exact hZ σ hσK
  · -- the involutions
    intro c hc hc2
    rw [hZ c hc, hyinf c hc hc2]
  · -- unramifiedness outside `cs(S)` at the places not split in `Λ`
    intro B hB hconj hnsplit σ hσK hσI
    rw [hZ σ hσK, hyS B hB hconj hnsplit σ hσK hσI]
  · -- the transfers agree on the decomposition group of a place split in `K`
    intro B hB σ hσ
    have hσK : σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup := hB hσ
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun s _ => ?_
    have hmem : (sec s)⁻¹ * σ * sec s ∈ K.fixingSubgroup :=
      conj_sec_mem_fixingSubgroup hsec s hσK
    rw [hZ _ hmem]

/-! ## The last clause as the single hypothesis of the node's conclusion -/

/-- **The node's conclusion from the five elementary clauses and the last clause itself.**

This is `Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_z_construction_of_zData` with Schmidt--Wingberg's sharpened
condition (b) replaced by the clause it is used to prove (the existence of `V`); it is the formal
observation that the node's conclusion has no content beyond those six clauses. -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_VClauseZData
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hzdata : ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0))) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  obtain ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, hzS, hzV⟩ := hzdata
  exact ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, hzS, hzV⟩

/-! ## The node's conclusion from the inertia-killing of the transfer of a class `z` -/

/-- **`shafarevich_z_construction` from a cochain `z` whose transfer kills the inertia of the
completely decomposed places outside `cs(S)`.**

The hypotheses on `z` are the five elementary clauses of the node's conclusion (cocycle, local
constancy, agreement with `y` on `cs(S)`, vanishing on the involutions, unramifiedness at the places
outside `cs(S)` that are not split in `Λ`) together with

> `∀ B ∉ cs(S), IsSplitIn k Λ B → ∀ σ ∈ decomp k B, IsInertia k B σ → transfer z sec σ = 0`.

That hypothesis is *incomparable* with the sixth hypothesis of
`Work.SSGRoute.shafarevich_z_construction_of_zData` (Schmidt--Wingberg's sharpened condition (b)):
condition (b) constrains the local components of `z` at the conjugates of `B` separately, and in the
case in which one conjugate carries the ramification it does *not* make the transfer vanish on the
inertia; conversely the inertia-killing condition says nothing about which conjugates are ramified. -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_inertiaKillingZData
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hzdata : ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ →
          Work.SSGRoute.transfer z sec σ = 0)) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, hzS, hztr⟩ := hzdata
  have hzadd : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, z (g * h) = z g + z h := by
    intro g hg h hh
    have h1 : SSGRoute.res k K g = 1 := (res_eq_one_iff_mem_fixingSubgroup (K := K) g).mpr hg
    rw [hzcoc g hg h hh, h1, one_smul]
  refine shafarevich_z_construction_of_VClauseZData p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y sec hsec
    ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, hzS, ?_⟩
  intro B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ
  have hsplitK : SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k K B :=
    le_trans hsplitΛ (IntermediateField.fixingSubgroup_le hKΛ)
  exact exists_V_of_transfer_inertia_vanishing p k Ω K E z sec hsec hzadd hzloc B hBfin hsplitK
    (fun σ hσd hσI => hztr B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ σ hσd hσI)

/-! ## The node's conclusion from a condition on the datum alone -/

/-- **`shafarevich_z_construction` from the inertia-killing of the transfer of the datum `y`.**

The cochain witnessing the conclusion is the extension of `y` by `0` off `G_K`, so the only
hypothesis beyond those of the node is

> `∀ B ∉ cs(S), IsSplitIn k Λ B, ∀ σ ∈ decomp k B, IsInertia k B σ → transfer y sec σ = 0`,

a condition on the datum `y` (and the chosen section `sec`) alone: **no arithmetic input is
needed.**  The node's conclusion follows from the datum's having the appropriate behaviour on the
inertia of the completely decomposed places outside `cs(S)`, and the residual content of the node is
exactly the difference between this condition and the hypotheses `ZHyp` on `y`. -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_transferInertia
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (hy : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, y (g * h) = y g + y h)
    (hyc : SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup y)
    (hyS : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → y σ = 0)
    (hyinf : ∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → y c = 0)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (htransfer : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ →
        Work.SSGRoute.transfer y sec σ = 0) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  classical
  -- the candidate: `y` extended by `0` off `G_K`
  let Z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E := fun σ => if σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup then y σ else 0
  have hZ : ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup → Z σ = y σ := by
    intro σ hσ
    simp only [Z, if_pos hσ]
  obtain ⟨hZcoc, hZloc, hZagree, hZinv, hZS, hZtr⟩ :=
    zClauses_of_agrees_on_fixingSubgroup p k Ω K Λ E S y Z hZ hy hyc hyS hyinf sec hsec
  refine shafarevich_z_construction_of_inertiaKillingZData p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y sec hsec
    ⟨Z, hZcoc, hZloc, hZagree, hZinv, hZS, ?_⟩
  intro B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ σ hσd hσI
  rw [hZtr B (le_trans hsplitΛ (IntermediateField.fixingSubgroup_le hKΛ)) σ hσd]
  exact htransfer B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ σ hσd hσI

/-! ## The paper's régime: `y` unramified at the conjugates of the relevant places -/

/-- **The "conjugate-unramified" hypothesis implies the inertia-killing hypothesis.**

If `y` vanishes on the inertia of every `G_k`-conjugate of `B` (the hypothesis under which
`Work.SSGRoute.transfer_vanishes_of_unramified` proves the last clause of the node), then the transfer
of `y` kills the inertia of `B` — this is
`Work.SSGRoute.ZConstruction.transfer_eq_zero_of_vanishes_on_conjugate_inertia`, applied term by term
to the transfer.  Consequently the inertia-killing route
(`shafarevich_z_construction_of_transferInertia`) *subsumes* the conjugate-unramified route. -/
theorem transfer_kills_inertia_of_conjugateUnramified
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hconj : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ (s : K ≃ₐ[k] K) (σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω),
        SSGRoute.IsInertia k ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) σ → y σ = 0) :
    (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ →
        Work.SSGRoute.transfer y sec σ = 0) := by
  intro B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ
  exact transfer_eq_zero_of_vanishes_on_conjugate_inertia (p := p) (k := k) (Ω := Ω) (K := K)
    (E := E) (z := y) (sec := sec) hsec B (le_trans hsplitΛ (IntermediateField.fixingSubgroup_le hKΛ))
    (fun s σ _ hσI => hconj B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ s σ hσI)

/-- **`shafarevich_z_construction` when the datum is unramified at every `G_k`-conjugate of every
completely decomposed place outside `cs(S)`.**

By `transfer_kills_inertia_of_conjugateUnramified` the transfer of `y` kills the inertia of those
places, so `shafarevich_z_construction_of_transferInertia` applies.  This covers the régime of
Schmidt--Wingberg's hypothesis (H1): a datum unramified at every place outside `cs(S)` is unramified
at every conjugate of such a place. -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_conjugateUnramified
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (hy : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, y (g * h) = y g + y h)
    (hyc : SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup y)
    (hyS : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → y σ = 0)
    (hyinf : ∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → y c = 0)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hconj : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ (s : K ≃ₐ[k] K) (σ : Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω),
        SSGRoute.IsInertia k ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) σ → y σ = 0) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  refine shafarevich_z_construction_of_transferInertia p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y hy hyc hyS hyinf
    sec hsec ?_
  exact transfer_kills_inertia_of_conjugateUnramified p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y sec hsec hconj

/-! ## A Λ-free sufficient condition: a class unramified outside `cs(S)` -/

/-- **`shafarevich_z_construction` from a class which is unramified outside `cs(S)`.**

The hypothesis is a cochain `z` with four elementary clauses (cocycle and locally constant on `G_K`,
equal to `y` on the decomposition groups of `cs(S)`, killing the involutions) together with

> `z` is unramified at every finite place outside `cs(S)`.

This implies the inertia-killing condition (2) of the module docstring — the conjugates of a place
outside `cs(S)` are again outside `cs(S)` — so the last clause holds by
`Work.SSGRoute.transfer_vanishes_of_unramified`.  Note that the hypothesis mentions neither `Λ` nor
the level `K`: the obligation is to realise the (necessarily unramified, by the node's `hyT`) local
data of `y` at `cs(S)` by a class whose ramification is confined to `cs(S)`.  This is a
Grünwald--Wang-type realisability problem, not a Poitou--Tate one; see §6 of
`ZConstruction/NOTE_session22.lean` for what the Grünwald input available in this workspace does and
does not give. -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_unramifiedOutsideClass
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hz : ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0)) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, hzunr⟩ := hz
  have hzadd : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, z (g * h) = z g + z h := by
    intro g hg h hh
    have h1 : SSGRoute.res k K g = 1 := (res_eq_one_iff_mem_fixingSubgroup (K := K) g).mpr hg
    rw [hzcoc g hg h hh, h1, one_smul]
  refine shafarevich_z_construction_of_VClauseZData p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y sec hsec
    ⟨z, hzcoc, hzloc, hzagree, hzinv, ?_, ?_⟩
  · -- the unramifiedness clause of the node
    intro B hB hnotconj hnsplit σ hσK hσI
    exact hzunr B hB hnotconj σ hσK hσI
  · -- the last clause, from the unramifiedness outside `cs(S)` of `z`
    intro B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ
    have hsplitK : SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k K B :=
      le_trans hsplitΛ (IntermediateField.fixingSubgroup_le hKΛ)
    exact transfer_vanishes_of_unramified p k Ω K E z hzadd hzloc sec hsec B hBfin hsplitK
      (fun s σ hσK hσI => hzunr ((sec s)⁻¹ • B)
        ((isFinPlace_smul_iff B (sec s)⁻¹).mpr hBfin)
        (fun A hA hc => hnotconj A hA ((isConjPlace_smul_iff A B (sec s)⁻¹).mp hc))
        σ hσK hσI)

/-! ## The régime of the paper's hypothesis (H1) -/

/-- **`shafarevich_z_construction` when the datum is unramified at every place outside `cs(S)`**
(the régime of Schmidt--Wingberg's hypothesis (H1)). -/
theorem shafarevich_z_construction_of_unramifiedOutside
    (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (k Ω : Type) [Field k] [NumberField k] [Field Ω] [Algebra k Ω]
    [IsAlgClosure k Ω]
    (K Λ : IntermediateField k Ω) [FiniteDimensional k K] [IsGalois k K]
    [FiniteDimensional k Λ] [IsGalois k Λ] [Fintype (K ≃ₐ[k] K)] (hKΛ : K ≤ Λ)
    (E : Type) [AddCommGroup E] [Module (ZMod p) E] [DistribMulAction (K ≃ₐ[k] K) E]
    [SMulCommClass (K ≃ₐ[k] K) (ZMod p) E] [Finite E]
    (S : Finset (ValuationSubring Ω)) (y : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E)
    (hy : ∀ g ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, ∀ h ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, y (g * h) = y g + y h)
    (hyc : SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup y)
    (hyS : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
      ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → y σ = 0)
    (hyinf : ∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → y c = 0)
    (sec : (K ≃ₐ[k] K) → (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) (hsec : ∀ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, SSGRoute.res k K (sec s) = s)
    (hunram : ∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
      (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
      ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → y σ = 0) :
    ∃ z : (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω) → E,
      SSGRoute.IsCocycleOn (SSGRoute.res k K) K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      SSGRoute.IsLocConstOn K.fixingSubgroup z ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∃ A ∈ S, SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, σ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B → z σ = y σ) ∧
      (∀ c ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, c ^ 2 = 1 → z c = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → ¬ SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∀ σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup, SSGRoute.IsInertia k B σ → z σ = 0) ∧
      (∀ B : ValuationSubring Ω, SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k B →
        (∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A B) → SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ B →
        ∃ V : Subgroup (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω), IsOpen (V : Set (Ω ≃ₐ[k] Ω)) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ u ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V, δ * u * δ⁻¹ ∈ V) ∧
          (∃ g ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B, ∃ m : ℤ, δ⁻¹ * g ^ m ∈ V) ∧
          (∀ δ ∈ SSGRoute.decomp k B ⊓ V,
            (∑ s : K ≃ₐ[k] K, s • z ((sec s)⁻¹ * δ * sec s)) = 0)) := by
  haveI : (Λ.fixingSubgroup).Normal := IsGalois.fixingSubgroup_normal_of_isGalois Λ
  refine shafarevich_z_construction_of_conjugateUnramified p k Ω K Λ hKΛ E S y hy hyc hyS hyinf
    sec hsec ?_
  intro B hBfin hnotconj hsplitΛ s σ hσI
  have hfinB : SSGRoute.IsFinPlace k ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) :=
    (isFinPlace_smul_iff B (sec s)⁻¹).mpr hBfin
  have hconjB : ∀ A ∈ S, ¬ SSGRoute.IsConjPlace k A ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) := fun A hA hc =>
    hnotconj A hA ((isConjPlace_smul_iff A B (sec s)⁻¹).mp hc)
  have hsplitB : SSGRoute.IsSplitIn k Λ ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) :=
    (isSplitIn_conj Λ (IsGalois.fixingSubgroup_normal_of_isGalois Λ) B (sec s)⁻¹).mpr hsplitΛ
  have hσK : σ ∈ K.fixingSubgroup :=
    IntermediateField.fixingSubgroup_le hKΛ (hsplitB hσI.1)
  exact hunram ((sec s)⁻¹ • B) hfinB hconjB σ hσK hσI

end Work.SSGRoute.ZConstruction
